  "title": "Spinach and Red Chard Quiche",
  "description": "This quiche has spinach, Swiss chard, onions, garlic, a slew of yummy spices, tofu, milk, parmesan and Cheddar cheese. But no eggs!",
  "authors": [
    "Melissa Richter Ayers"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-05-17T10:47:50-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2018-06-08T09:13:41-04:00",
